@host = http://localhost:5087

### Create a user
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "pw" }

### Create a post
POST {{host}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hello", "body": "First post", "userId": 1 }

### Add a comment
POST {{host}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Nice!", "userId": 1, "postId": 1 }

### Get the post with comments
GET {{host}}/posts/1?includeComments=true